  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `Request-a-Test-Notification` endpoint returns this response, which includes a `testNotificationToken` value to reference the test associated with your request. When you request a test notification, the App Store server sends a notification with the `TEST` `notificationType` to your server. To learn the result of the App Store server’s attempt to send the `TEST` notification, call `Get-Test-Notification-Status` with the `testNotificationToken`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/Request-a-Test-Notification",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/SendTestNotificationResponse/testNotificationToken",
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/AppStoreServerNotifications/notificationType",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/Get-Test-Notification-Status"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For more information about notifications, see `AppStoreServerNotifications`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/AppStoreServerNotifications"
          ]
        }
